@startuml sequence_password_change
title Authenticated Password Change (FR-048)

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend

User -> Frontend : open account settings,\nselect change password
User -> Frontend : enter current_password,\nnew_password
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/v1/account/password/\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>\nbody: { current_password, new_password }

Backend -> Backend : verify current_password\nagainst stored hash
Backend -> Backend : validate new_password\n(ADS-FR-003-01, ADS-SEC-003-01:\n8–128 chars, not common,\nnot all-numeric, not email-similar)

alt current_password correct AND new_password valid
  Backend -> Backend : set_password(new_password)
  Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK (empty body)
  Frontend -> User : show confirmation,\nclear password fields
else current_password incorrect
  Backend --> Frontend : 400 Bad Request\nfield error on current_password
  Frontend -> User : show error,\nstored password unchanged
else new_password fails policy
  Backend --> Frontend : 400 Bad Request\nfield error on new_password
  Frontend -> User : show error,\nstored password unchanged
end

@enduml
